      "sourceText": "这个进阶写法的重点是：`extern \"C\"` 只放在最外层、最简单的接口上，也就是 `cpp_main(void)`。真正的 C++ 代码放在 `cpp_interface.cpp` 后面，`swap` 可以使用命名空间，以后也可以继续使用类、模板、函数重载等 C++ 功能，只要这些 C++ 专有内容不要直接暴露给 `main.c`。",
      "translatedText": "The key point of this advanced approach is:`extern \"C\"` place it only on the outermost, simplest interface, that is, `cpp_main(void)`\\. The actual C++ code is placed after `cpp_interface.cpp`\\. `swap` can use namespaces, and in the future can also continue to use C++ features such as classes, templates, and function overloading, as long as these C++\\-specific contents are not directly exposed to `main.c`\\.",
