      "contextFingerprint": "f018903eca0309c4e95d84285431f0ed66a8f97a806a77db8fff77ed27483192",
      "sourceText": "因此，**导航时会读取二维图和PCD；实时匹配的是“当前三维点云与保存的三维PCD”。** 不是把PCD与二维图片互相匹配，也不是每帧先存一份PCD再匹配。当前small_gicp按约0.5 s的定时器处理累计点云，只有匹配收敛才更新结果；这不保证每0.5 s都得到正确定位。常规导航不启动slam_toolbox和这个二维扫描转换节点，也没有用它们进行实时二维地图匹配。接线见[slam_launch.py](/home/tungchiahui/UserFolder/MySource/ysu2026_rm_sentry/ysu2026_rm_sentry_nav/src/pb2025_sentry_nav/pb2025_nav_bringup/launch/slam_launch.py:126)、[localization_launch.py](/home/tungchiahui/UserFolder/MySource/ysu2026_rm_sentry/ysu2026_rm_sentry_nav/src/pb2025_sentry_nav/pb2025_nav_bringup/launch/localization_launch.py:135)。",
      "translatedText": "Therefore,**During navigation, the 2D map and PCD are read; what is matched in real time is the “current 3D point cloud and the saved 3D PCD\\.”** It is not matching the PCD with a 2D image, nor saving a copy of the PCD each frame before matching\\. The current small_gicp processes the accumulated point cloud on a timer of about 0\\.5 s, and updates the result only when matching converges; this does not guarantee correct localization every 0\\.5 s\\. Normal navigation does not start slam_toolbox or this 2D scan conversion node, nor does it use them for real\\-time 2D map matching\\. For wiring, see[slam_launch.py](/home/tungchiahui/UserFolder/MySource/ysu2026_rm_sentry/ysu2026_rm_sentry_nav/src/pb2025_sentry_nav/pb2025_nav_bringup/launch/slam_launch.py:126)、[localization_launch.py](/home/tungchiahui/UserFolder/MySource/ysu2026_rm_sentry/ysu2026_rm_sentry_nav/src/pb2025_sentry_nav/pb2025_nav_bringup/launch/localization_launch.py:135)\\.",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 281,
        "outputTokens": 193,
        "costUsd": 0.000316
      }
    },
