      "translatedText": "You can add, remove, or modify these options yourself as needed, following the previous instructions\\. If the cmake command fails, it is usually due to missing dependencies or incorrect generation options in the configuration; check based on the prompt information\\. If it succeeds, you can proceed to compilation (Makefiles compilation):",
